{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52014","headline":"山中独坐 · 王绩","name":"山中独坐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"试逐游山去，聊观避俗情。\n引流还当井，凭树即爲楹。\n酒中添药气，琴里作松声。\n石鑪煎玉髓，土釜出金精。\n水碧连年服，云丹计日成。\n还看市朝路，无处不营营。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王绩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52014.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52014","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}